==Strategy==
*Due to the presence of Le'Solar, you should pick a damage dealer with over 400 range. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is a viable option, though most Ubers above that range would be preferable. Also bring high-damaging cats and [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Aliens]] with freeze/knockback abilities.
*Always bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] if possible.
*Your main goal here is to either kill Le'Solar before backup can arrive to help her, or killing Mesmocosmocyclone, who can teleport your meatshields leaving your damage dealers without protection.
*Hyppoh and Imperator Sael aren't immediate threats. To kill Le'Solar fast, send out a Barrier Breaker to destroy her [[Barrier]] and use a fast-attacking unit (such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]) to take out [[Those Guys]]. Then, you should have saved enough money to send out Awakened Bahamut and kill Le'Solar.

